<div class="mxcpfdea ptb70p">
	<div class="w1350 clearfix">
    	<div data-aos="fade-up" aos-easing="ease-in-quad" data-aos-delay="400" aos-duration="300">
            <!--<p class="puben mxcpfwxbt1">介绍</p>-->
            <h3 class="pubcn mxcpfwxbt2">Introduction</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="mxcpfdeap1" data-aos="fade-up" aos-easing="ease-in-quad" data-aos-delay="600" aos-duration="300">
            MetaX C600 is a new-generation general-purpose GPU (GPGPU) from MetaX, engineered on its proprietary GPGPU architecture and domestic advanced process technology. It delivers exceptional multi-precision computing power and large-capacity high-bandwidth memory. Integrated with MetaXLink interconnect technology for flexible multi-GPU scaling and the MXMACA software stack compatible with mainstream GPU ecosystems, it enables broad application in intelligent computing centers, general-purpose computing, and data analytics. Designed in an OAM module form factor with support for both air and liquid cooling, it offers deployment flexibility for diverse environments.        </div>
    </div>
</div>


